### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = TU_TOKEN_JWT_AQUI

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### USUARIOS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════

### Registrar usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuario@ejemplo.com",
  "password": "mipassword123"
}

###

### Validar email
PUT {{baseUrl}}/user/validation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuario@ejemplo.com",
  "code": "123456"
}

###

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuario@ejemplo.com",
  "password": "mipassword123"
}

###

### Actualizar datos personales
PUT {{baseUrl}}/user/register
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan",
  "surnames": "García López",
  "nif": "12345678A",
  "phone": "612345678"
}

###

### Crear/Actualizar compañía
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/user/company
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mi Empresa SL",
  "cif": "B12345678",
  "address": {
    "street": "Calle Mayor",
    "number": "1",
    "postal": "28001",
    "city": "Madrid",
    "province": "Madrid"
  }
}

###

### Obtener usuario autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Eliminar usuario (soft)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/user?soft=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### CLIENTES
### ═══════════════════════════════════════

### Crear cliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/client
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Construcciones García SA",
  "cif": "A87654321",
  "email": "info@garcia.com",
  "phone": "913456789",
  "address": {
    "street": "Avenida de la Constitución",
    "number": "25",
    "postal": "41001",
    "city": "Sevilla",
    "province": "Sevilla"
  }
}

###

### Listar clientes (con paginación y filtros)
GET {{baseUrl}}/client?page=1&limit=10&name=García&sort=-createdAt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Obtener cliente por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/client/ID_DEL_CLIENTE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Actualizar cliente
PUT {{baseUrl}}/client/ID_DEL_CLIENTE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "912345678"
}

###

### Archivar cliente (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/client/ID_DEL_CLIENTE?soft=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Eliminar cliente (hard delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/client/ID_DEL_CLIENTE?soft=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Listar clientes archivados
GET {{baseUrl}}/client/archived
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Restaurar cliente archivado
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/client/ID_DEL_CLIENTE/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### PROYECTOS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════

### Crear proyecto
POST {{baseUrl}}/project
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Reforma Oficinas Madrid",
  "projectCode": "PRJ-2025-001",
  "client": "ID_DEL_CLIENTE",
  "address": {
    "street": "Gran Vía",
    "number": "50",
    "postal": "28013",
    "city": "Madrid",
    "province": "Madrid"
  },
  "email": "proyecto@ejemplo.com",
  "notes": "Proyecto de reforma integral de oficinas"
}

###

### Listar proyectos
GET {{baseUrl}}/project?page=1&limit=10&client=ID_CLIENTE&active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Obtener proyecto por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/project/ID_DEL_PROYECTO
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Actualizar proyecto
PUT {{baseUrl}}/project/ID_DEL_PROYECTO
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Notas actualizadas",
  "active": false
}

###

### Archivar proyecto
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/project/ID_DEL_PROYECTO?soft=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Listar proyectos archivados
GET {{baseUrl}}/project/archived
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Restaurar proyecto
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/project/ID_DEL_PROYECTO/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### ALBARANES
### ═══════════════════════════════════════

### Crear albarán de horas
POST {{baseUrl}}/deliverynote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "project": "ID_DEL_PROYECTO",
  "client": "ID_DEL_CLIENTE",
  "format": "hours",
  "description": "Instalación eléctrica planta baja",
  "workDate": "2025-06-15",
  "hours": 8,
  "workers": [
    { "name": "Pedro Martínez", "hours": 4 },
    { "name": "Ana López", "hours": 4 }
  ]
}

###

### Crear albarán de materiales
POST {{baseUrl}}/deliverynote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "project": "ID_DEL_PROYECTO",
  "client": "ID_DEL_CLIENTE",
  "format": "material",
  "description": "Suministro de materiales de construcción",
  "workDate": "2025-06-15",
  "material": "Cemento Portland",
  "quantity": 100,
  "unit": "kg"
}

###

### Listar albaranes (con filtros)
GET {{baseUrl}}/deliverynote?page=1&limit=10&format=hours&signed=false&from=2025-01-01&to=2025-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Obtener albarán por ID (con populate)
GET {{baseUrl}}/deliverynote/ID_DEL_ALBARAN
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Descargar PDF de albarán
GET {{baseUrl}}/deliverynote/pdf/ID_DEL_ALBARAN
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Firmar albarán (multipart/form-data)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/deliverynote/ID_DEL_ALBARAN/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="signature"; filename="firma.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./firma.png
------FormBoundary--

###

### Eliminar albarán
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/deliverynote/ID_DEL_ALBARAN
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### HEALTH CHECK
### ═══════════════════════════════════════

### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health
